WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.069 --> 00:00:05.859
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and this week
on Orphan Black we met a new clone, learned

00:00:05.859 --> 00:00:10.759
a lot more about Sarah’s life pre season
1 and the Helena Prolethean plot just got

00:00:10.759 --> 00:00:12.910
really really creepy.

00:00:12.910 --> 00:00:16.410
Let’s dedicate this video to the memory
of Ainsley.

00:00:16.410 --> 00:00:20.230
If you’re finding me for the first time,
I’m doing weekly vids for Orphan Black Season

00:00:20.230 --> 00:00:21.910
2, be sure to subscribe to get everything.

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:25.400
I know a lot of you in international countries
have to wait to watch it.

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:27.359
So these will just be here for you when you
need them.

00:00:27.359 --> 00:00:30.140
So let’s break a leg and talk about our
Top 5 Moments, then I’ll do my review.

00:00:30.140 --> 00:00:32.890
Careful for spoilers if you haven’t seen
the episode yet.

00:00:32.890 --> 00:00:33.890
Here we go.

00:00:33.890 --> 00:00:36.590
Number 5 - Art Finds The Proletheans.

00:00:36.590 --> 00:00:40.039
It seems like everytime Art and Angela have
a scene together she invokes Beth.

00:00:40.039 --> 00:00:43.800
She’s been trying to guilt him into resuming
the mystery of the clones and it looks like

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:44.800
she was successful.

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:47.610
Art will hopefully be able to save Helena.

00:00:47.610 --> 00:00:52.670
Because Gracie seems like the only Prolethean
who’s not 100% committed to making Helena

00:00:52.670 --> 00:00:56.160
the newest Sister Wife, I’m hoping she helps
Art get her out.

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:58.039
Number 4 - Allison falls off the Stage.

00:00:58.039 --> 00:01:01.309
Poor Blood Ties was doomed before it ever
began.

00:01:01.309 --> 00:01:07.030
I love how thematically the plot of the play
works so well with Allison’s real life Ainsley

00:01:07.030 --> 00:01:08.530
Clone Club drama.

00:01:08.530 --> 00:01:12.300
No surprise that she shotgunned all that booze
and pills.

00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:15.650
Let me know if you thought she was going to
react like that on stage or if you thought

00:01:15.650 --> 00:01:18.370
she would just pull some great performance
out of her butt.

00:01:18.370 --> 00:01:25.500
Tatiana Maslany in real life would probably
have turned it into an Emmy winner.

00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:27.549
It’s so surreal watching Allison perform
the play too.

00:01:27.549 --> 00:01:31.940
It’s an actor Tatiana Maslany, peforming
a character, Allison, who’s performing a

00:01:31.940 --> 00:01:33.180
play, Blood Ties.

00:01:33.180 --> 00:01:36.170
And even though Allison was supposed to collapse
under the pressure.

00:01:36.170 --> 00:01:37.860
The whole thing was just amazing.

00:01:37.860 --> 00:01:41.610
We seriously need to make sure she wins that
Emmy this year.

00:01:41.610 --> 00:01:44.229
Number 3 - Meeting The New Clone Jennifer

00:01:44.229 --> 00:01:47.850
The body horror that was going on with the
Cosima Delphine story this week was almost

00:01:47.850 --> 00:01:48.850
hard to watch.

00:01:48.850 --> 00:01:52.619
Did you notice the way Cosima reacted when
they were dissecting Jennifer?

00:01:52.619 --> 00:01:56.720
After all the tapes and the surgery it was
like she had to watch her own slow gruesome

00:01:56.720 --> 00:01:57.720
death.

00:01:57.720 --> 00:02:02.560
I love how good the show is at putting you
into their perspective.

00:02:02.560 --> 00:02:06.180
I loved how she saw Jennifer being kept in
the dark and told Delphine to not be a bitch

00:02:06.180 --> 00:02:13.380
and just tell her the truth no matter what.

00:02:13.380 --> 00:02:17.380
In case you missed it too, they identified
that the source of the cancer, the growths,

00:02:17.380 --> 00:02:18.920
was inside the Uterus.

00:02:18.920 --> 00:02:26.070
It means that any of the clones that are infertile
potentially have growths that are spreading.

00:02:26.070 --> 00:02:35.330
That includes Rachel, Cosima, Allison and
we’re not sure about Helena yet.

00:02:35.330 --> 00:02:39.030
Jennifer was the first clone to exhibit symptoms,
even though we met Katja first.

00:02:39.030 --> 00:02:42.540
In the timeline, she died three days before
the events in this episode.

00:02:42.540 --> 00:02:45.680
Number 2 - The Proletheans Force Helena to
Marry Henrik

00:02:45.680 --> 00:02:49.440
The show hasn’t been super clear on the
technicalities of a prolethean marriage.

00:02:49.440 --> 00:02:52.840
But I’d bet Henrik has been bound to Multiple
Women.

00:02:52.840 --> 00:02:57.291
In an episode where we had to watch Jennifer
degenerate and get dissected on a table, I

00:02:57.291 --> 00:03:00.530
feel like this Helena plot was more disturbing.

00:03:00.530 --> 00:03:03.670
Did anyone else scream at their TV when Henrik
was carrying her down that hallway?

00:03:03.670 --> 00:03:07.020
I really do hope Gracie ends up helping her
escape.

00:03:07.020 --> 00:03:11.230
Even if it’s not altruistic, I feel like
any help at all would be a blessing.

00:03:11.230 --> 00:03:16.030
Speaking of which, it seems like based on
Henrik’s “instruments in the war for creation”

00:03:16.030 --> 00:03:20.490
speech, the proletheans will be the crazy
group this season that will escalate things.

00:03:20.490 --> 00:03:24.560
I feel like it’s easier to trust someone
like Leekie, because he’s operating from

00:03:24.560 --> 00:03:28.850
a place of pure science, which is all about
reliability and precision.

00:03:28.850 --> 00:03:33.600
He’s evil, but you can predict what he might
do because he’s coming from a place of logic.

00:03:33.600 --> 00:03:38.040
The Proletheans on the other hand seem like
they bend situations to suit their needs and

00:03:38.040 --> 00:03:40.980
“as long as you do it in God’s name”,
anything goes.

00:03:40.980 --> 00:03:42.930
So they will be starting some fires.

00:03:42.930 --> 00:03:44.740
Keep your eyes peeled on them.

00:03:44.740 --> 00:03:47.790
And my number 1 moment - Meet Cal, Your Dad.

00:03:47.790 --> 00:03:52.240
Did anyone else have a second where they just
thought of Daario.

00:03:52.240 --> 00:03:56.370
Once he and Sarah started to work through
their relationship and the WTF reveal of Kira

00:03:56.370 --> 00:03:58.660
being his daughter, I really enjoyed his character.

00:03:58.660 --> 00:04:02.410
It’s a little strange hearing him with an
American accent, but I can’t wait to see

00:04:02.410 --> 00:04:03.410
where his story goes.

00:04:03.410 --> 00:04:05.900
I’m guessing he’ll just stay part of the
Sarah plot.

00:04:05.900 --> 00:04:09.060
But every once and a while different clones
stories will overlap.

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:13.560
So we could get some Cal Alison scenes or
Cal and Cosima depending on where the season

00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:14.560
goes.

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:19.250
I really do expect him to rub off on Kira.

00:04:19.250 --> 00:04:24.450
She seems so intuitive that she’s almost
like a fully grown adult just walking around

00:04:24.450 --> 00:04:26.300
in a child’s body.

00:04:26.300 --> 00:04:30.610
Did anyone else expect him to be a deadshot
with that rifle and just kill Daniel?

00:04:30.610 --> 00:04:34.050
Until that whole car crash I kind of thought
her story would get folded into Cosima’s

00:04:34.050 --> 00:04:35.380
back at the lab.

00:04:35.380 --> 00:04:40.330
We saw a bunch of Mrs. S scenes in the teaser
for episode 4, so I wonder if it was her that

00:04:40.330 --> 00:04:42.180
crashed into their car?

00:04:42.180 --> 00:04:45.760
But let me know what your biggest WTF moment
was in the episode.

00:04:45.760 --> 00:04:47.240
And who your favorite Clone was.

00:04:47.240 --> 00:04:55.160
It’s hard to pick between Cal being Kira’s
father and Helena being abused by the proletheans.

00:04:55.160 --> 00:04:58.080
But my favorite clone was definitely Jennifer.

00:04:58.080 --> 00:04:59.080
May she rest in peace.

00:04:59.080 --> 00:05:02.160
Overall I gave the episode an A minus for
doing such a good job of introducing this

00:05:02.160 --> 00:05:04.610
new Cal wrinkle to the plot.

00:05:04.610 --> 00:05:11.420
I don’t know how many episodes he’s in,
but let’s hope he survives to season 3.

00:05:11.420 --> 00:05:15.080
The good thing about Orphan Black and his
other show Game of Thrones, is that they don’t

00:05:15.080 --> 00:05:16.180
shoot at the same time.

00:05:16.180 --> 00:05:20.650
So even though he was upgraded to cast regular
for season 5 of Game of Thrones, he can still

00:05:20.650 --> 00:05:24.300
film episodes of Orphan Black season 3 if
it gets renewed.

00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:30.380
Speaking of actors, I’m sure we’re all
in agreement that Tatiana Maslany is a goddess,

00:05:30.380 --> 00:05:40.140
but just thinking about all the nuances she
brings to each of the different clones is

00:05:40.140 --> 00:05:41.140
mind boggling.

00:05:41.140 --> 00:05:44.430
And every time we meet a new clone she always
surprises me.

00:05:44.430 --> 00:05:48.600
I feel like if you asked her too she could
just sit in a room and do all the clones having

00:05:48.600 --> 00:05:53.360
a conversation with themselves, just seamlessly
jumping in and out of different characters.

00:05:53.360 --> 00:05:55.930
Like a one-person clone club stage play.

00:05:55.930 --> 00:05:57.710
Blood Ties style.

00:05:57.710 --> 00:06:00.300
Allison needs to take some notes.

00:06:00.300 --> 00:06:03.930
I’ve gotten so invested in the moment of
each new episode that I keep forgetting about

00:06:03.930 --> 00:06:16.460
the overplot, the Project LEDA mystery and
Leekie and the Proletheans endgame.

00:06:16.460 --> 00:06:20.550
Are we even sure what the Proletheans would
do with another Kira if Helena really could

00:06:20.550 --> 00:06:21.550
get pregnant?

00:06:21.550 --> 00:06:25.810
We know Leekie is trying to patent human DNA,
they’re just a mega corporation trying to

00:06:25.810 --> 00:06:26.810
get rich.

00:06:26.810 --> 00:06:30.380
Even if the Proletheans don’t care about
money it seems like their end result is the

00:06:30.380 --> 00:06:31.380
same.

00:06:31.380 --> 00:06:35.040
Just a bunch of homogenized humans made in
whatever they consider to be their perfect

00:06:35.040 --> 00:06:36.040
image.

00:06:36.040 --> 00:06:40.730
I wonder if in their scenario everyone on
the planet would get married to each other

00:06:40.730 --> 00:06:43.470
in one huge creepy binding ceremony.

00:06:43.470 --> 00:06:44.720
Yikes.

00:06:44.720 --> 00:06:46.180
Let me know what you’re final thoughts are
on the episode.

00:06:46.180 --> 00:06:47.930
I totally loved the new characters they introduced.

00:06:47.930 --> 00:06:51.300
I can’t wait to see what they do with Daario
on the show.

00:06:51.300 --> 00:06:54.330
So my next Orphan Black video will post after
episode 4 next week.

00:06:54.330 --> 00:06:55.920
Be sure to subscribe to get it.

00:06:55.920 --> 00:06:59.150
Tomorrow is all about Game of Thrones as usual.

00:06:59.150 --> 00:07:02.970
Right now click here for last week’s Orphan
Black video and click here to catch up on

00:07:02.970 --> 00:07:03.970
Game Of Thrones.

00:07:03.970 --> 00:07:04.970
Thanks for watching, see you guys tomorrow.

00:07:04.970 --> 00:07:05.270
High Fives!

